  97 00315 2023         ISZ NOTE        / Last note?
  98 00316 7410         SKP             / No, go get next
  99 00317 7402         HLT             / Yes, halt
 100 00320 5206         JMP START
 101 00321 0000 DELAY,  0000            / Magic subroutine
 102 00322 2036         ISZ L           / Duration expired?
 103 00323 5331         JMP DELAYX      / No, return
 104 00324 2040         ISZ CNT         / Yes, bump tempo ounter
 105 00325 7410         SKP
 106 00326 5314         JMP FIN         / Tempo expired, go wrap up
 107 00327 1035         TAD L0          / Set up another duration
 108 00330 3036         DCA L
 109 00331 5721 DELAYX, JMP I DELAY     / Return to caller
 110 00332 7000 CDAM,   NOP
 111 00333 1043 DFIX,   TAD DAMP
 112 00334 1335 DDFIX,  TAD DAMP2
 113 00335 0000 DAMP2,  0
 114 00336 0000 AMP2,   0
